{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b58be01b8b431cf88a7093b965977b00.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old boring heroes? We hear you. In UniqKiller, you create heroes with distinct appearances, skills, and styles for PvP battles in urban environments! The controls are so simple, that even your grandma could play. But don\u2019t get us wrong \u2013 it\u2019s fast, intense, and packed with endless possibilities. Play on PC or mobile, build your own path, and watch your &quot;Uniqks&quot; shine and reach the spotlights .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/939ab597461143fe5157af9fda0b1aff.avif?t=1760910981\" width=776 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of settling for pre-made characters that need to be unlocked, you will have the experience of combining different body types, body parts, outfit parts, combat classes, skills and weapons to create a unique hero. In the same way that happens in a RPG, in UniqKiller the character creation process of your hero will impact your gameplay and your hero (UNIQK) progression tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.poster.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.webm?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/060fde7f875b516fec06ad63cbc23fea.avif?t=1760910981\" width=776 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an auto shooting system, simple and intuitive controls, quick matches, and a top-down camera that changes the perspective of traditional shooters, UniqKiller brings new possibilities to you. But don't worry! UniqKiller offers an unlimited amount of possible combinations for your heroes, elevating the level of complexity and strategic thinking required for the player to really stand out among others, whether you are a beginner or a pro player. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.poster.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.webm?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.mp4?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.poster.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.webm?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.mp4?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/56ecd455ab27204de8e56104805aba43.avif?t=1760910981\" width=776 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or against your friends, make alliances or engage wars. It's all about standing out, whether solo or with your team. UniqKiller gives you the tools to leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.poster.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.webm?t=1760910981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1046de84f8e9c54ba5ebc2417c62f52e.avif?t=1760910981\" width=776 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UniqKiller is a free to play topdown third-person shooter, cross platform (PC and mobile) and crossplay, meaning that you can play whenever you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/6e85f7e3dd3a60e1528190a8376c4097.avif?t=1760910981\" width=681 height=257 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3099330?t=1760910981","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/2fbc6ed2ff748fd9b67e1d759f6b0302f56c5223/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760910981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/84f0d18847cf323e38c953dded01541f255bbcbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760910981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/84f0d18847cf323e38c953dded01541f255bbcbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760910981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b58be01b8b431cf88a7093b965977b00.avif?t=1760910981\" width=1138 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old boring heroes? We hear you. In UniqKiller, you create heroes with distinct appearances, skills, and styles for PvP battles in urban environments! The controls are so simple, that even your grandma could play. But don\u2019t get us wrong \u2013 it\u2019s fast, intense, and packed with endless possibilities. Play on PC or mobile, build your own path, and watch your &quot;Uniqks&quot; shine and reach the spotlights .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/939ab597461143fe5157af9fda0b1aff.avif?t=